#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md:1 5748815b0202475887b39042c5f7fe4b
msgid "分体控制 vs 全身控制"
msgstr "分体控制 vs 全身控制"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md:3 d2a7b0d5a5834cc48c967f58b8458514
msgid ""
"Two real launch paths in [ocs2_arm_controller](https://github.com"
"/fiveages-"
"sim/arms_ros2_control/tree/main/controller/ocs2_arm_controller/launch), "
"also offered as **split body** / **full body** in the [open-deploy-ws "
"`arx-lift2s` README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws/blob"
"/arx-lift2s/README.EN.md)."
msgstr ""
"[ocs2_arm_controller](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/arms_ros2_control/tree/main/controller/ocs2_arm_controller/launch) 中有两条真实 launch 路径，在 [open-deploy-ws `arx-lift2s` README](https://github.com/fiveages-sim/open-deploy-ws/blob/arx-lift2s/README.EN.md) 中也对应 **split body** / **full body**。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md 3a12c9a49c8d4ac3a51d300ad3898004
msgid "**分体控制** (split)"
msgstr "**分体控制**（split）"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md 5fd1d2bf6a0e4c9683cba248f95cc59e
msgid "**全身控制** (whole-body)"
msgstr "**全身控制**（whole-body）"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md defe95ac0dd84fa1a2173bc2122a746a
msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md eed8ce84cfb643988d9c5901f5e8cfd9
msgid "Arms and body/head (and typically hands) run as **separate** controllers"
msgstr "手臂与身体/头（通常还有手）由**各自独立**的控制器运行"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md 5059c4f1fc2e4400a7943a86e53cebf1
msgid "One **unified** whole-body MPC controller"
msgstr "一个**统一**的全身 MPC 控制器"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md 3a77c0c1b3e5439596b571d59e3aefd4
msgid "Arm / body"
msgstr "手臂 / 身体"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md bf723d4a33984961929c57f433b2a36f
msgid ""
"[ocs2_arm_controller](../4-reference/controllers/2-ocs2_arm_controller.md)"
" + "
"[basic_joint_controller](../4-reference/controllers/7-basic_joint_controller.md)"
" (`setup_body_controllers` for `body` and `head`)"
msgstr ""
"[ocs2_arm_controller](../4-reference/controllers/2-ocs2_arm_controller.md) + [basic_joint_controller](../4-reference/controllers/7-basic_joint_controller.md)（`setup_body_controllers` 用于 `body` 和 `head`）"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md a7496bb4fabb4062b751bd8a26b63864
msgid ""
"[ocs2_wbc_controller](../4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md) using "
"`ocs2_wheel_humanoid`"
msgstr ""
"[ocs2_wbc_controller](../4-reference/controllers/3-ocs2_wbc.md)，使用 `ocs2_wheel_humanoid`"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md 38bd6762fbae417dbdf4682e56865af6
msgid "Launch"
msgstr "启动"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md 81532dd9d4ec4e4bbcd614f952d4a54b
msgid ""
"`ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller split_body.launch.py` (`launch_mode` "
"`split_body`)"
msgstr ""
"`ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller split_body.launch.py`（`launch_mode` `split_body`）"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md c284b59eb2ce4fc288b8c3f044536d79
msgid ""
"`ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller full_body.launch.py` (`launch_mode` "
"`full_body`) when the robot config type is "
"`ocs2_wbc_controller/Ocs2WbcController`"
msgstr ""
"当机器人配置 type 为 `ocs2_wbc_controller/Ocs2WbcController` 时：`ros2 launch ocs2_arm_controller full_body.launch.py`（`launch_mode` `full_body`）"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md 35df7c6656c64054bb1c455d27e48710
msgid "Lift2S menu"
msgstr "Lift2S 菜单"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md f06a44fd679041c8a56ec45149c248dc
msgid "`./quick_start.sh` → Launch → Lift2S → **split body**"
msgstr "`./quick_start.sh` → Launch → Lift2S → **split body**"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md 8cc6c8581fcb4e8cac23617cdcfa5a02
msgid "same menu → **full body**"
msgstr "同一菜单 → **full body**"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md:12
#: 46db92179db64394b79026e97f0605f0
msgid ""
"Do not treat `split_body.launch.py` as whole-body control. There is no "
"public README that lists a standalone `ros2 launch ocs2_wbc_controller …`"
" entry; `full_body.launch.py` is the in-tree loader."
msgstr ""
"不要把 `split_body.launch.py` 当成全身控制。公开 README 没有单独的 `ros2 launch ocs2_wbc_controller …` 入口；`full_body.launch.py` 才是树内加载器。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md:14
#: c4f062dd0ebe4325b4c0560b25a756f2
msgid "Packages (do not invent)"
msgstr "软件包（不要编造）"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md:16
#: 08559d93d9ff4be0bf71efeed22183b1
msgid ""
"**basic_joint_controller** — joint FSM Home / Hold / MoveJ; "
"`/fsm_command` is `std_msgs/Int32`. How-to: [Use "
"basic_joint_controller](../2-how_to/11-basic_joint.md)."
msgstr ""
"**basic_joint_controller** — 关节 FSM Home / Hold / MoveJ；`/fsm_command` 是 `std_msgs/Int32`。操作指南：[使用 basic_joint_controller](../2-how_to/11-basic_joint.md)。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md:17
#: 2b4e1af02b184096b54046b94c89263d
msgid "**ocs2_arm_controller** — arm MPC FSM HOME / OCS2 / HOLD (package README)."
msgstr "**ocs2_arm_controller** — 手臂 MPC FSM HOME / OCS2 / HOLD（软件包 README）。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md:18
#: d9de4200e678434d90457ed3dd2dac44
msgid ""
"**ocs2_wbc_controller** — private submodule; whole-body MPC. This docs "
"set does not invent its states or topics."
msgstr "**ocs2_wbc_controller** — 私有子模块；全身 MPC。本文档不编造其状态或话题。"

#: ../../source/3-concepts/7-split_vs_wbc.md:20
#: ddf63f19c55247e4ad5a7520d57a56df
msgid ""
"FSM command values: [FSM and Topics](4-fsm_and_topics.md). Controllers "
"index: [Controllers reference](../4-reference/controllers/0-index.md)."
msgstr ""
"FSM 命令值：[状态机与话题](4-fsm_and_topics.md)。控制器索引：[控制器参考](../4-reference/controllers/0-index.md)。"
